# Secrets and tokens

- Dev secrets live in gitignored `config/dev.secrets.exs`. Commit `config/dev.secrets.exs.example` only.
- Never commit `secret_key_base`. Prod reads `SECRET_KEY_BASE` from the environment and raises if missing.
- Host tokens and other credentials are hidden in the UI by default (screen-share safe). Do not put them in the DOM until the user reveals them.
- Pin Elixir/OTP in `.tool-versions` to match the Dockerfile (`erlang 27.3`, `elixir 1.18.4-otp-27`).
